msgid "\"My dear Mr. Bennet,\" said his lady to him one day, \"have you heard that Netherfield Park is let at last?\" Mr. Bennet replied that he had not. \"But it is,\" returned she; \"for Mrs. Long has just been here, and she told me all about it.\" Mr. Bennet made no answer."
msgstr "\"Mi querido Sr. Bennet,\" le dijo un día su esposa, \"¿ha oído que al fin se ha alquilado Netherfield Park?\" El Sr. Bennet respondió que no. \"Pues así es,\" replicó ella; \"porque la Sra. Long acaba de estar aquí y me lo ha contado todo.\" El Sr. Bennet no respondió."

